WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
That thing, what kind of thing should I give to Jade Girl?

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,000
I asked Yin Yun to send it away

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
As a mother-in-law, I can't open my mouth.

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:11,420
Ayu, that prince has inconvenient legs and feet

5
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:16,580
My sister-in-law specially picked it for you.

6
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,580
Always do what you feel comfortable with

7
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:25,740
What are you afraid of?

8
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,340
I’ve never seen strong winds and waves.

9
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,140
I am the woman who wants to take care of her

10
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,340
Never give it away

11
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:42,020
Something to say

12
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,420
So exciting
